# Read by `vite build` (production mode).
#
# You do not normally write this file. `just web-publish` generates it from
# the deployed stack's own `ApiUrl` and then builds, so the two halves cannot
# drift apart. Copy this only to build a bundle by hand against something else.
#
# Whatever origin the built app is served from must also be listed in the
# backend's `CorsOrigins` (infra/samconfig.toml), and the backend redeployed,
# or every call fails the preflight before your code sees anything.
#
# Everything here ships inside the bundle. Never put a secret in this file.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://example.lambda-url.us-east-1.on.aws
